  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 3.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.62,
      "end_seconds": 10.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.4,
      "end_seconds": 16.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a shaky feeling in my hands"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.79,
      "end_seconds": 21.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.08,
      "end_seconds": 25.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "probably about a month. Yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.2,
      "end_seconds": 32.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "okay give me more detail on it whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.98,
      "end_seconds": 44.23,
      "duration_seconds": 11.25,
      "text": "I notice it more with caffeine and stress. Maybe a three out of ten on a a bad day. I've also had sweaty palms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.09,
      "end_seconds": 48.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Have you had butterflies in your stomach?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.02,
      "end_seconds": 53.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "yeah, that too"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.8,
      "end_seconds": 58.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.11,
      "end_seconds": 67.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "let me think, years back I got feeling very drowsy from tramadol, so I stay away from it now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.1,
      "end_seconds": 84.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.6,
      "end_seconds": 96.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.44,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.81,
      "end_seconds": 101.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.5,
      "end_seconds": 109.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "I've got low haemoglobin i did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.62,
      "end_seconds": 114.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.84,
      "end_seconds": 124.3,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "Iron tablets. I take it once a day. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.74,
      "end_seconds": 132.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.97,
      "end_seconds": 140.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.98,
      "end_seconds": 147.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "have you had any weight loss, fainting, weakness or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.77,
      "end_seconds": 157.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "No weight loss, fainting, weakness or palpitations, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.91,
      "end_seconds": 161.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "alright, how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.11,
      "end_seconds": 164.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.5,
      "end_seconds": 169.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.98,
      "end_seconds": 179.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "so, sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.6,
      "end_seconds": 210.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18 heart rate 66 SpO2 98 percent on room air. And blood pressure 111 over 68 temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.9,
      "end_seconds": 213.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.05,
      "end_seconds": 218.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.48,
      "end_seconds": 222.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "now I'm gonna do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.88,
      "end_seconds": 226.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.43,
      "end_seconds": 241.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "there is a fine, fast tremor that goes away when the hands are resting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.62,
      "end_seconds": 247.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.79,
      "end_seconds": 273.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.84,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: I'm honestly not certain yet it could be an anxiety or caffeine-related tremor, or it might be an overactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.95,
      "end_seconds": 278.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "oh, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.68,
      "end_seconds": 288.83,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an anxiety or caffeine-related tremor do well once it's treated properly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.49,
      "end_seconds": 309.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.0,
      "text": "A thyroid test is what I'd like next, for tremor. Cut down caffeine and try slow breathing when it starts. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.19,
      "end_seconds": 314.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Thank you, um, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}